edge of Nature (1782), which was published for many years after in eleven editions.\n\nEmilie du Chatelet's translation of what Newton work was published after her death in 1756?\nWhat is the answer? (If it cannot be answered, return \"unanswerable\")"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Emilie du Chatelet's translation of Sir Isaac Newton's work \"Principia\" was published after her death in 1756."}]}
