{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are an AI assistant that helps people find information. User will you give you a question. Your task is to answer as faithfully as you can. While answering think step-by-step and justify your answer."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Test for natural language inference.\nPremise: \"A choir performing on stage with photographer in the audience.\"\nHypothesis: \"A choir getting their pictures taken during a performance.\"\nIs the hypothesis entailed by the premise?\nOptions:\n- yes\n- no\n- it is not possible to tell A step-by-step solution is:\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Step 1: Identify the key elements in the premise and hypothesis.\nPremise: A choir performing on stage with a photographer in the audience.\nKey elements: choir, performing, stage, photographer, audience.\n\nHypothesis: A choir getting their pictures taken during a performance.\nKey elements: choir, pictures taken, performance.\n\nStep 2: Compare the key elements between the premise and hypothesis.\n- Both mention a choir and a performance.\n- The premise mentions a stage and audience, while the hypothesis does not.\n- The premise mentions a photographer, while the hypothesis mentions pictures taken.\n\nStep 3: Determine if the hypothesis is entailed by the premise.\n- The premise states that there is a photographer in the audience while the choir is performing on stage.\n- The hypothesis suggests that the choir is getting their pictures taken during a performance.\n\nSince the premise includes a photographer present during the performance, it is reasonable to infer that the photographer could be taking pictures of the choir. Therefore, the hypothesis is entailed by the premise.\n\nAnswer: yes"}]}
