ulliver's Travels capture Horror?\nAnswer: In the fantasy section\n\nQuestion: How does Richard escape from the dragon's stomach?\nAnswer: By using a beanstalk from Jack and the Beanstalk\n\nQuestion: How many books is a person usually allowed to check out at the library?\nAnswer: Two\n\nQuestion: How has Richard changed when he returns home after his adventure?\nAnswer: He becomes a braver kid"}]}
