s. In the same 15 minutes, Valerie will have completed 80 skips/minute * 15 minutes = 1,200 skips. Together, Roberto and Valerie will have completed a total of 1,050 skips + 1,200 skips = 2,250 skips in 15 minutes. The answer is 2,250."}]}
