 themselves from Cosby. NBC canceled a proposed pilot project, and TV Land ceased showing reruns of \"The Cosby Show\". Less than a day prior, Netflix had postponed the stand-up comedy special.\n\nFor Cosby, these setbacks could not have come at a worse time. After a lull, Cosby had returned to the limelight with a vengeance, with multiple concerts a year and plans for two stand-up comedy films. However, with these new and old accusations coming to the fore, his triumphal return to the national stage has withered in the face of public outrage, throwing the future of his career into uncertainty."}]}
