he Belgian province of Antwerp, on 15 May 1928. Bob Mendes is a pseudonym, which is a name used by an individual for a specific purpose, different from their original or true name. In this case, Bob Mendes is known as a Belgian writer, establishing a relationship between him and Belgium."}]}
