 mortality among patients with ocular inflammation treated with immunosuppressive drugs: retrospective cohort study.\"\n\nComparing the content of the abstract and the title, it can be seen that the title accurately represents the main points and conclusions of the abstract.\n\nOutput: yes"}]}
