y 3 by the sale price on day 1 and multiply by 100:\n(0.85*(0.9*0.95*P)) / (0.95*P) * 100\n\nThe \"P\" on both numerator and denominator will cancel out, which leaves us with:\n0.85 * 0.9 * 100 = 76.5\n\nStep 4: Choose the correct answer from the given options.\nThe correct answer choice is 76.5 %, which corresponds to option d.\n\nAnswer: d. 76.5 %"}]}
