Microsoft or MS) is an American multinational technology company headquartered in Redmond, Washington, that develops, manufactures, licenses, supports and sells computer software, consumer electronics and personal computers and services. Its best known software products are the Microsoft Windows line of operating systems, Microsoft Office office suite, and Internet Explorer and Edge web browsers. Its flagship hardware products are the Xbox video game consoles and the Microsoft Surface tablet lineup. As of 2016, it was the world's largest software maker by revenue, and one of the world's most valuable companies.    After reading the paragraphs above, we are interested in knowing the entity with which 'tony hawk's underground 2' exhibits the relationship of 'publisher'. Find the answer from the choices below.  Choices: - 1994  - activision  - actor  - bandai  - century  - europe  - ibm  - japan  - microsoft  - microsoft windows  - neo geo  - nintendo  - north america  - pocket  - redoctane  - russia  - samsung  - sega  - sony  - sony computer entertainment  - south korea  - taiwan  - the atlantic  - vicarious visions\nThe answer to this question is:"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "activision"}]}
